WEBVTT

00:12.770 --> 00:14.770
Please, open!

00:23.020 --> 00:24.820
<i>Wait for me, Takuma.</i>

00:25.490 --> 00:27.960
<i>I won't let you become a demon.</i>

00:48.040 --> 00:50.050
When did I first notice

00:50.050 --> 00:52.050
That your fingers were

00:52.050 --> 00:55.710
So beautiful

00:56.020 --> 00:59.720
And when did I notice this feeling?

01:00.060 --> 01:03.020
So fast that I'll be run over

01:03.020 --> 01:05.660
I cannot keep up

01:05.660 --> 01:09.000
My fearful heart

01:09.000 --> 01:11.730
Puts on the brakes

01:12.170 --> 01:14.530
Our eyes meet

01:15.400 --> 01:16.540
We talk about something

01:16.540 --> 01:19.740
When you look at me

01:20.040 --> 01:24.480
I cannot move

01:26.080 --> 01:33.750
My beating heart is about to break

01:34.060 --> 01:38.030
The arms that catch me pull me

01:38.030 --> 01:42.060
I can't suppress it, I can't express it

01:42.060 --> 01:46.730
That I like you

01:47.070 --> 01:50.040
So much it hurts

01:50.040 --> 01:57.740
The beginning of a love that won't let me breathe

02:01.480 --> 02:05.440
Memory of

02:01.480 --> 02:05.440
a Dream

02:06.650 --> 02:10.750
<i>Grandma will know right away that
I broke through the barrier.</i>

02:12.430 --> 02:13.550
<i>I have to hurry.</i>

02:31.780 --> 02:33.940
This barrier is stronger than the last one.

02:39.420 --> 02:40.290
It's okay.

02:40.820 --> 02:42.620
I'm sure I can open this barrier, too.

03:07.820 --> 03:10.410
The Onikirimaru seal is weakening.

03:12.390 --> 03:16.020
May the one bring good fortune to the world once again.

03:19.130 --> 03:22.530
By such a wish, the blood barrier was made strong.

03:28.500 --> 03:30.440
Blood barrier?

03:35.710 --> 03:38.040
<i>Did I just see the ceremonial offering?</i>

03:39.050 --> 03:40.310
Tamaki.

03:42.580 --> 03:44.180
Lady Baba is waiting for you.

03:45.420 --> 03:46.790
Mitsuru...

03:48.720 --> 03:50.990
Will you come to the storehouse?

03:58.670 --> 04:02.070
Okay. I have something
I'd like to ask her, too.

04:03.710 --> 04:07.370
I believe I told you not to act selfishly.

04:08.080 --> 04:10.670
I looked into the Onikirimaru.

04:11.910 --> 04:13.080
And?

04:13.080 --> 04:15.640
I saw someone sinking into a pond.

04:16.220 --> 04:18.080
Is that the ceremonial offering?

04:20.120 --> 04:21.180
I see...

04:21.590 --> 04:23.180
So now you know.

04:26.530 --> 04:30.100
Onikirimaru's release long ago,

04:30.100 --> 04:32.230
and its incomplete seal,

04:33.200 --> 04:36.300
were protected by the blood and souls of people

04:36.300 --> 04:38.900
to keep the end of the world contained.

04:40.880 --> 04:44.610
Onikirimaru, that enormous power,

04:44.610 --> 04:47.850
cannot be controlled without sacrifice.

04:47.850 --> 04:49.370
Isn't that right?

04:53.250 --> 04:58.290
The people said to have been spirited away in this village

04:58.290 --> 05:00.660
were not taken away by the gods.

05:03.000 --> 05:06.300
Spiriting away is the background work of the Tamayori.

05:07.740 --> 05:10.840
That has always been the responsibility of the

05:10.840 --> 05:12.930
Tamayori branch family's shrine maiden.

05:14.310 --> 05:18.800
Yes, Mitsuru bears all of the Tamayori's sins.

05:20.250 --> 05:21.480
Mitsuru?

05:22.650 --> 05:26.110
Even so, the Onikirimaru seal continues to weaken.

05:27.620 --> 05:32.930
That which could normally only be released by the Tamayori princess

05:32.930 --> 05:37.370
can now be released by people like Logos.

05:39.500 --> 05:44.400
The strain of a thousand years can no longer be suppressed.

05:44.970 --> 05:46.130
That's...

05:46.640 --> 05:50.580
But, if we look, there must be another way.

05:52.110 --> 05:54.550
You should worry about yourself,

05:55.550 --> 05:56.450
Tamayori princess.

05:57.220 --> 05:59.020
Documents remain which indicate

05:59.020 --> 06:01.560
that previous Tamayori princesses have been able

06:01.560 --> 06:04.790
to suppress the Onikirimaru by offering their own lives.

06:05.360 --> 06:08.160
According to them, by offering the Tamayori princess' blood,

06:08.160 --> 06:11.100
the seal can become even more complete.

06:11.700 --> 06:12.690
In other words,

06:14.100 --> 06:15.500
you're going to die.

06:17.540 --> 06:21.580
You, who have never sacrificed anything, will have to sacrifice yourself.

06:21.580 --> 06:24.310
If you can demonstrate true justice,

06:24.310 --> 06:25.640
you'll be satisfied, won't you?

06:26.480 --> 06:28.970
Unfortunately, you don't have a choice.

06:31.020 --> 06:32.040
Tamaki.

06:32.690 --> 06:36.120
That's what it means to be the Tamayori princess.

06:37.190 --> 06:38.120
Grandma...

06:38.730 --> 06:41.750
Soon, we will perform the sealing ritual.

06:42.200 --> 06:44.560
You're going to wait here until then.

06:56.510 --> 07:02.920
Once I've seen you trade your life to complete the seal, I'll follow you.

07:05.020 --> 07:09.420
Because I'm sure that death is a lonely road to travel alone.

07:19.270 --> 07:20.390
O-chan!

07:25.410 --> 07:26.600
That's right.

07:27.110 --> 07:31.010
O-chan, you have to continue living.

07:59.410 --> 08:00.510
Hey!

08:00.510 --> 08:01.840
What are you doing here?

08:01.840 --> 08:03.610
Oh, well...

08:04.110 --> 08:06.410
I was worried about Tamaki.

08:06.410 --> 08:07.400
Where is she?

08:07.920 --> 08:09.680
In that storehouse.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.820
What?

08:10.820 --> 08:13.810
So you mean, she's been confined?

08:15.190 --> 08:17.750
They really mean to do it.

08:18.960 --> 08:19.950
You two.

08:22.260 --> 08:23.700
What are you doing there?

08:26.670 --> 08:29.690
That's right! We're here to do a straw figure exorcism.

08:29.970 --> 08:33.340
This place is off limits to unauthorized persons.

08:33.340 --> 08:34.330
How did you get in?

08:34.780 --> 08:37.470
Well... How did we?

08:38.210 --> 08:42.310
You're in the same class as Tamaki.

08:43.620 --> 08:47.320
Well, since Tamaki and
Onizaki have been missing school,

08:47.320 --> 08:49.220
I got worried, so I decided to come.

08:49.220 --> 08:50.160
In the middle of the night?

08:54.400 --> 08:55.450
Right?

08:57.800 --> 08:59.730
Are you all fine with this?

08:59.730 --> 09:01.200
What?!

09:00.230 --> 09:01.200
Mahiro.

09:02.100 --> 09:03.470
What are you trying to say?

09:03.910 --> 09:05.770
I'm asking, are you happy having the sealing system

09:05.770 --> 09:07.580
beaten into your heads since you were kids,

09:07.580 --> 09:10.670
and having been turned into tools for the old Ugaya woman?

09:11.910 --> 09:13.280
What?!

09:14.580 --> 09:16.780
Stop fighting, stop fighting.

09:17.080 --> 09:20.780
How do you know so much about the guardians?

09:28.560 --> 09:30.660
That storehouse...

09:30.970 --> 09:33.330
stinks of the hatred of blood.

09:37.870 --> 09:40.600
Hey, wait!

09:41.840 --> 09:43.070
Should we go after them?

09:43.540 --> 09:45.240
No, more importantly...

09:46.510 --> 09:48.880
The barrier around the storehouse has gotten stronger.

09:51.750 --> 09:54.750
Could something have happened to Tamaki?

10:02.360 --> 10:03.390
Mahiro.

10:03.930 --> 10:06.260
I'm going to see Lady Baba.

10:07.570 --> 10:08.870
Mahiro.

10:17.480 --> 10:19.210
Are you planning on sacrificing Tamaki?!

10:20.080 --> 10:21.950
Lady Baba, that's not right, is it?!

10:24.320 --> 10:26.950
You're the one who told me that it was

10:26.950 --> 10:30.760
the Atori house's duty to be sacrificed for the Onikirimaru seal.

10:31.630 --> 10:36.460
I resolved myself to that fate when I was still a kid.

10:37.200 --> 10:39.360
I drove the idea into my head,

10:39.770 --> 10:41.360
erased the records,

10:41.700 --> 10:45.970
and lived believing that someday I would be sacrificed.

10:47.680 --> 10:51.700
And Tamaki just came to this village,

10:51.980 --> 10:54.310
and only just became the Tamayori princess.

10:54.850 --> 10:56.940
Why does she have to die?

10:57.790 --> 11:00.780
I'll be the sacrifice for the seal!

11:01.090 --> 11:03.650
It's too late for that, Mahiro.

11:06.090 --> 11:07.560
Don't you understand?

11:08.030 --> 11:11.000
You cannot fulfill that purpose anymore.

11:13.700 --> 11:15.440
The Onikirimaru is already at the point

11:15.440 --> 11:19.600
where only the Tamayori princess' blood can seal it.

11:22.610 --> 11:24.080
But how...

11:24.610 --> 11:27.510
How can you know without trying?!

11:28.320 --> 11:29.810
Kill me!

11:30.220 --> 11:31.450
Mahiro!

11:31.820 --> 11:33.050
Kill me!

11:36.490 --> 11:39.990
If we had the Artifacts...
Even though it's only a slim chance,

11:39.990 --> 11:41.690
we might be able to seal the Onikirimaru, right?

11:42.060 --> 11:43.160
Probably not.

11:44.430 --> 11:45.960
How can you be so sure?

11:46.370 --> 11:49.670
The Onikirimaru's strength has returned to the point

11:49.670 --> 11:52.370
where that sort of seal won't work anymore.

11:53.240 --> 11:57.010
You should have already realized that by now, right?

11:58.680 --> 12:00.150
That's how it is.

12:00.650 --> 12:03.680
If Tamaki's life alone is enough to save the world,

12:03.680 --> 12:05.120
then that's enough.

12:05.450 --> 12:07.560
That's unacceptable!

12:07.560 --> 12:08.650
Be silent.

12:10.260 --> 12:12.830
Henceforth, you guardians will not be permitted

12:12.830 --> 12:15.160
to speak on this matter anymore.

12:16.660 --> 12:18.000
Screw this!

12:19.100 --> 12:20.890
Mahiro.

12:22.240 --> 12:26.570
Until the ceremony is completed without a hitch,

12:26.870 --> 12:29.810
you all will continue to strengthen the defense around the shrine.

12:30.140 --> 12:33.410
It appears that some outsiders entered a while ago.

12:49.230 --> 12:52.130
Haven't you found what you're looking for yet?

12:52.970 --> 12:58.410
But that magician's spell cannot be dispelled that easily.

13:01.480 --> 13:04.570
You said that I resembled your mother.

13:06.410 --> 13:07.710
Why do you think that is?

13:08.150 --> 13:09.120
I wonder.

13:09.480 --> 13:12.010
I was a homunculus.

13:12.490 --> 13:15.750
By a miracle through Logos,
I was able to live as a human.

13:16.820 --> 13:20.190
It appears that your mother was the model.

13:22.660 --> 13:24.220
Why are you telling me this?

13:25.600 --> 13:26.930
I don't know.

13:29.500 --> 13:32.470
However, in order to obtain the Artifact,

13:32.470 --> 13:34.710
we'll plant many seeds.

13:34.710 --> 13:37.800
That sort of thing is easy for Logos to do.

13:38.480 --> 13:41.610
Drei, who has come through all of this as a magician,

13:42.450 --> 13:44.750
is a detestable and stubborn man.

13:45.050 --> 13:47.750
What an interesting story.

13:48.290 --> 13:53.030
However, you must have had some reason

13:53.030 --> 13:54.830
to tell me all that.

13:56.430 --> 13:57.920
It's for Aria.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.360
Aria?

14:01.700 --> 14:04.170
Because I let my guard down to you.

14:06.370 --> 14:10.680
Without Aria, we cannot steal the Artifact.

14:10.680 --> 14:14.010
So that's why Drei is now under house arrest.

14:14.750 --> 14:16.480
The problem is what happens next.

14:17.350 --> 14:21.020
As he watches me take such thorough care of Aria,

14:21.020 --> 14:26.150
he may intend to ignore Aria's order and try to do something with the Artifacts.

14:26.730 --> 14:29.960
Perhaps he's attempting to control the Onikirimaru's power?

14:31.230 --> 14:33.170
Can he do that?

14:33.670 --> 14:36.190
I don't think it will be that easy.

14:36.840 --> 14:42.080
But in any case, you and
Aria don't trust Drei.

14:42.080 --> 14:43.870
Is that right?

14:44.180 --> 14:49.480
Yes. That's why I made it my priority to team up with you and steal the Artifacts.

15:02.730 --> 15:04.130
Well, well.

15:04.130 --> 15:08.160
I'm so grateful that you came to meet us.

15:12.370 --> 15:16.280
The result of the assembly of the four wise men.

15:16.280 --> 15:18.980
Yes, the Black Book's prophecy indicates

15:18.980 --> 15:22.420
that the time to steal the Artifact has come.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.350
Is that so?

15:26.050 --> 15:27.250
Then,

15:28.460 --> 15:30.420
we'll have to make our move tomorrow.

15:35.530 --> 15:36.830
Very well.

15:42.770 --> 15:45.540
<i>Don't come to me anymore.</i>

15:47.440 --> 15:49.070
<i>Please go home.</i>

16:07.490 --> 16:08.830
Tamaki?

16:08.830 --> 16:09.890
<i>Takuma?</i>

16:12.370 --> 16:13.770
I'm sorry.

16:14.070 --> 16:15.470
I'm so sorry.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.640
So you were sealed.

16:28.580 --> 16:30.410
Who are you?

16:31.290 --> 16:34.780
I am the god that was driven from his land.

16:37.620 --> 16:41.660
Powerful gods visited my land and took everything from me,

16:41.660 --> 16:44.060
turning me into an Underworld god.

16:46.470 --> 16:48.660
I lost everything.

16:49.340 --> 16:51.140
A place where I could feel at ease.

16:51.140 --> 16:52.770
A family to love.

16:53.370 --> 16:56.140
I pledge vengeance.

16:56.140 --> 17:00.510
I will kill all of those gods and put an end to everything.

17:03.750 --> 17:06.410
I approached a lone girl.

17:06.890 --> 17:09.290
The name of that girl was the Tamayori princess.

17:09.790 --> 17:13.850
The god who protects the sword that has the power to end the world.

17:19.700 --> 17:22.670
We exchanged a vow,

17:22.670 --> 17:27.130
and I asked the Tamayori princess to let me borrow the sword.

17:32.810 --> 17:37.720
With its power, I killed many gods.

17:37.720 --> 17:40.150
It was a heroic battle.

17:40.420 --> 17:43.650
The world was enveloped in darkness and despair.

17:52.900 --> 17:56.000
Crying, the Tamayori princess spoke,

17:56.000 --> 17:59.800
Isn't that the same as what was done to you?

18:00.540 --> 18:04.380
What will spreading misfortune bring you?

18:05.280 --> 18:07.980
When I returned to myself,

18:08.280 --> 18:11.290
I was already corroded by the power that was released,

18:11.290 --> 18:13.880
and I could not seal it away.

18:14.620 --> 18:15.680
Then...

18:17.060 --> 18:19.580
The only one who can control the sword is me.

18:21.960 --> 18:23.360
That's why...

18:30.940 --> 18:32.770
So you were sealed...

18:34.810 --> 18:37.870
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

18:39.410 --> 18:43.820
Why did I release this sword?

18:46.290 --> 18:47.620
Don't cry.

18:48.260 --> 18:50.880
You're not the only one who has done wrong.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.520
I'm sorry.

18:57.830 --> 18:59.530
I'm so sorry.

19:00.270 --> 19:03.930
As a guardian, I will protect you forever.

19:04.810 --> 19:06.800
You and the seal.

19:08.310 --> 19:12.210
<i>I know this... This is my memory.</i>

19:13.610 --> 19:16.180
<i>And this voice belongs to the person</i>

19:16.180 --> 19:18.620
<i>who has always protected me.</i>

19:23.890 --> 19:28.230
<i>He's clumsy and violent, but he's really kind.</i>

19:29.330 --> 19:30.820
<i>Takuma,</i>

19:32.000 --> 19:33.760
<i>it was you after all.</i>

19:35.170 --> 19:38.000
<i>The person who kept whispering to me in my dreams.</i>

19:54.350 --> 19:56.990
I am the reincarnation of the Tamayori princess.

19:56.990 --> 19:59.720
Takuma, you are the reincarnation of the Underworld god.

20:03.830 --> 20:10.070
Takuma, the power inside you is the power of the Underworld god from ancient times.

20:11.100 --> 20:14.040
Different from the demon of a thousand years ago,

20:14.040 --> 20:16.530
that was blamed for everything.

20:17.580 --> 20:22.350
And you swore with me to protect the seal for all time.

20:24.020 --> 20:26.780
I want to tell you this, Takuma.

20:28.020 --> 20:31.580
But it doesn't look like
I have time for that anymore.

20:32.530 --> 20:36.160
But this time, I can end it with this.

20:36.700 --> 20:39.220
If I seal the Onikirimaru.

20:41.240 --> 20:43.100
I'm sorry.

20:43.100 --> 20:45.900
Forgive me, Takuma.

20:46.740 --> 20:48.300
As if I could forgive you!

20:49.110 --> 20:51.580
Hey, can you hear me, Tamaki?

20:52.410 --> 20:53.910
Takuma?

20:53.910 --> 20:56.040
I can't let it end here.

20:57.380 --> 20:59.690
The Osaki fox came for me.

20:59.690 --> 21:02.490
He showed me his memories directly.

21:03.690 --> 21:07.680
I guess he learned how to do that at some point.

21:09.530 --> 21:12.400
Even though the Tamayori princess' order is absolute,

21:12.400 --> 21:15.440
even though you told me to leave, I came.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.660
Say something.

21:18.270 --> 21:20.240
You mustn't, Takuma.

21:20.610 --> 21:22.100
You finally spoke.

21:23.380 --> 21:25.110
Don't worry about me.

21:25.610 --> 21:29.740
My desire to protect you is stronger than anything else.

21:30.320 --> 21:32.050
Those are my feelings.

21:34.090 --> 21:37.520
Only when I am with you, am I myself.

21:47.630 --> 21:51.400
Say it. Tell me what you want me to do.

22:00.980 --> 22:10.520
The red sky stains time itself as it envelops us

22:10.520 --> 22:19.300
Did you hug me back so tightly because you're worried?

22:19.870 --> 22:24.970
Tell me everything about the dream you had

22:24.970 --> 22:29.440
That you just started to say, but stopped yourself

22:29.440 --> 22:34.550
We drew each other closer with clumsy hands

22:34.550 --> 22:41.360
Let's embrace the sign guiding us to the same future

22:41.360 --> 22:50.960
Only you, only you, will I swear to love through it all

22:50.960 --> 23:00.840
So keep that smile I want to protect beside me always

23:00.840 --> 23:10.420
I'm sure it was inevitable that
I would feel your tears

23:10.420 --> 23:18.890
So I'll become a breeze that blows on your eyes

23:18.890 --> 23:24.560
I promise you

23:36.180 --> 23:37.410
Even I...

23:39.910 --> 23:41.910
can say what needs to be said.

23:43.920 --> 23:45.650
I love you!

23:45.650 --> 23:47.380
I won't let anyone else have you.

23:48.220 --> 23:50.350
Senpai,

23:52.190 --> 23:53.920
you're mine alone.

23:55.100 --> 24:00.970
Next Time: Their Resolution
